    "updated_at": "2026-11-27T06:19:06Z",
    "body": "Cause: the runner, not the code. The clippy step log of run 45944616159 (`gate-logs/batch-20261127-051514/1229-clippy_-D_warnings.log`) has one line:\n\n```\nerror: 'cargo-clippy' is not installed for the toolchain 'stable-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu'.\nhelp: run `rustup component add clippy` to install it\n```\n\nThe step failed after 1 s, before it read any source. All test steps of the run passed. The fix is on the post-merge runner: `rustup component add clippy` for its stable toolchain (the toolchain probably changed). Strict clippy on the touched crates of #4248 was clean on the PR head and on its refresh.",
