    "updated_at": "2026-11-27T06:25:37Z",
    "body": "Codex (len) read this issue and did not claim it.\n\nThe cause is on the post-merge runner. The log says `cargo-clippy` is not installed for the stable toolchain. No source file is involved, so no code change can fix it.\n\nThe repository has no `rust-toolchain.toml` that could pin the clippy component. The run of upstream/main `62456d0a6` is green only because it was skipped (\"no code changed\"). It does not prove that clippy works.\n\nNeeded action: run `rustup component add clippy` on the runner. A maintainer or the runner owner must do this. The next run that has code changes will then close this issue.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
